                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00478/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00156/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目样式为一个普通的电灯开关。不论灯泡和该项目是否处于电路中，和它处于同一室内的所有电灯都会受它影响被它控制。该影响将在项目或电灯不处于同一室内后消除。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>中国东北部一市民家中，<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site-CN-02异常物品仓库墙上。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>一个没接电的开关能让一个还没拧上灯头的灯泡亮起来这种事我还真是头一次见到。&#8212;&#8212;Dr.Freezingheart</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">作者的话</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>[如果有更好的整改意见请私信我呦~]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00156" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00156" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00156-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6401769&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416669" alt="Freezingheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6401769)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;">Freezingheart</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588752775 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 May 2020 08:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支原产于比利时的FN FNC突击步枪，只有在弹匣井内插有巧克力块时才能射出子弹。若插入正常弹匣，则项目只会射出5.56×45mm子弹形状的巧克力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>武警部队特种警察大队██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██异常武器收容单元<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>射出的巧克力吃起来特别甜。</em>——Dr. Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00398" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00398-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416669" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600577702 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Sep 2020 04:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00395/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一根橡胶棒和一块皮毛，在相互摩擦时会放出200伏特，5安的电流<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██中学物理实验室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-██的低价值异常物品存放区内，正在研究将该物品用于维持站点电力供应的方法<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这摩擦起电也太离谱了吧！-Dr.S</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00395" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00395" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00395-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bruce-s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6737882); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6737882&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416669" alt="BRUCE-S" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6737882)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bruce-s" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6737882); return false;">BRUCE-S</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600427760 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">18 Sep 2020 11:16</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00436/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把M1911手枪。使用时，将枪口对准一名手中持有任意复杂器械的人员，按下扳机后项目将使目标手中的复杂器械被解体成零件。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>混沌分裂者三号哨站<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>无效化。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>以后不准有人随便拿异常照镜子，除非经过了授权。</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00436" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00436" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00436-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285604); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416669" alt="Chris Evertworth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285604); return false;">Chris Evertworth</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602166748 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Oct 2020 14:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00426/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台高度450mm的座便器，人员将会在使用该项目进行排遗时获得心理上的极大满足感，并认为“这是人生中最幸福的时刻”。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███市的某一无障碍卫生间内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被运送至Site-CN-██站点内的公共厕所<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>好吧，当看见无障碍卫生间门口排着那么长的队伍时，我就知道出问题了。——Dr.███</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00426" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00426" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00426-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yyue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5044404); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5044404&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416669" alt="yyue" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5044404)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yyue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5044404); return false;">yyue</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601732513 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">03 Oct 2020 13:41</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00339/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张标有“口袋妖怪火红*损坏”的GBA卡带，包装和卡带封画被涂抹。当该卡带被运行时会被自动弹出，并会使插入者在48小时内看和听见的一切被用《口袋妖怪叶绿》中所含素材表示。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>天津市一家电玩店内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存在基金会低风险物品保管库内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“说实话，还挺烦的，但重点是根本没法玩。这就是想上班玩游戏的代价吗？”———Dr.██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00339" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00339" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00339-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aslive" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3657592); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3657592&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416669" alt="Aslive" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3657592)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aslive" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3657592); return false;">Aslive</a></span></p>
